{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026dZr6LUVBIw1795682759.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>張曦雯（Kelly）與高海寧（高Ling）在早前播出的《璀璨之城》中「鬥餐死」，她們在戲內為了各自的「老公」不惜一切做任何事，而Kelly更十分憎恨高Ling。不過，原來戲外的二人其實老友鬼鬼！</p><p></p><p>日前，Kelly在社交網分享了一段短片。片中見她先以素顏上陣，對著鏡頭展露甜美笑容；隨後鏡頭一轉，便見她孖著高Ling「著到靚靚」地開心擺Pose，二人更擺出同一個甫士，表現得非常開心。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"0bac93c9-7cd5-490a-9bd7-d6ebdba5e17a.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026i1G4LnMciV1795682759.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"d3a14353-f67b-4110-b188-ca04b048117d.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026dMXrqYo34u1795682759.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>Kelly同時在帖文中留言寫道：「A happy ending for 官家少奶s」。片段發布後，吸引很多粉絲讚好，大家更大讚二人「靚到冇得頂」！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:03:53.557087+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":265,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T08:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T21:57:37.284453+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T09:57:16.421853+00:00","content_hash":"69153f98341a4a5affd9a11046ab46a1f87f14d80e49009e00b58f401064e4ea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:03:53.557087+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}